.mdx",{"_97":494,"_104":114,"_99":66,"_108":495,"_117":-7,"_12":65,"_119":496},"es:platform/updates/limitations.mdx","Lo que Lamassu Updates no soporta o aún no hace, reunido en un solo lugar y con la página que explica cada punto.",{"_121":497},"platform/updates/limitations.mdx","es:platform/updates",{"_254":500},"platform/updates/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud-download shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 13v8l-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m12 21 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M4.393 15.269A7 7 0 1 1 15.71 8h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 2.436 8.284\"></path></svg>",{"_104":105,"_99":503,"_106":-7,"_107":-7,"_108":-7,"_110":-7,"_101":504,"_97":526,"_119":527,"_117":-7},"Administración",[505,512,519],{"_97":506,"_104":114,"_99":507,"_108":508,"_117":-7,"_12":509,"_119":510},"es:platform/administration/access-control.mdx","Control de acceso","Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/administration/access-control",{"_121":511},"platform/administration/access-control.mdx",{"_97":513,"_104":114,"_99":514,"_108":515,"_117":-7,"_12":516,"_119":517},"es:platform/administration/audit-logs.mdx","Registros de auditoría","Entiende qué eventos de auditoría genera Lamassu y cómo convertirlos en una pista durable.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/administration/audit-logs",{"_121":518},"platform/administration/audit-logs.mdx",{"_97":520,"_104":114,"_99":521,"_108":522,"_117":-7,"_12":523,"_119":524},"es:platform/administration/alerts.mdx","Alertas y suscripciones","Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/administration/alerts",{"_121":525},"platform/administration/alerts.mdx","es:platform/administration",{"_254":528}